        "Abstract": "This paper proposes a methodology for collecting and processing a dataset to adapt text-to-image models to understand Russian cultural code. The dataset is created by collecting images from the web and manually annotating them with captions. The resulting dataset is used to fine-tune the Kandinsky 3.1 model, improving its cultural awareness and generation quality for Russian cultural entities."
